{
 "dur": 74.0,
 "vo": [
  {
   "id": "v01",
   "t": 0.3,
   "chunks": [
    "What if one machine",
    "controlled the future of AI?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v02",
   "t": 3.58,
   "chunks": [
    "This is an",
    "EUV lithography machine.",
    "And you see, only one company",
    "on Earth can build it."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v03",
   "t": 8.95,
   "chunks": [
    "It starts with molten tin,",
    "dripping through a vacuum."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "t": 11.98,
   "chunks": [
    "A CO\u2082 laser hits them.",
    "50,000 times a second."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "t": 15.94,
   "chunks": [
    "Each bursts into plasma,",
    "40\u00d7 hotter than",
    "the Sun's surface."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "t": 19.99,
   "chunks": [
    "It glows at",
    "13.5 nanometres.",
    "Extreme ultraviolet."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "t": 24.56,
   "chunks": [
    "Why the vacuum?",
    "Air swallows this light.",
    "So does glass."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "t": 27.9,
   "chunks": [
    "So no lenses.",
    "Only mirrors."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "t": 30.1,
   "chunks": [
    "Each one stacks dozens of",
    "molybdenum and silicon layers."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "t": 33.57,
   "chunks": [
    "How smooth?",
    "Scaled to Germany,",
    "the tallest bump is 1 mm."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "t": 37.69,
   "chunks": [
    "The light hits a patterned mask,",
    "then shrinks onto a wafer."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "t": 41.05,
   "chunks": [
    "Both stages sprint,",
    "yet align within nanometres."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v13",
   "t": 44.49,
   "chunks": [
    "Transistor gates?",
    "Around 20 nanometres.",
    "A hair? 80,000."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v14",
   "t": 48.67,
   "chunks": [
    "Each costs around",
    "$150 million.",
    "The newest, nearly 400."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v15",
   "t": 53.55,
   "chunks": [
    "Shipping one takes",
    "40 containers",
    "and 3 cargo planes."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v16",
   "t": 57.23,
   "chunks": [
    "And China?",
    "ASML has never shipped it one.",
    "Dutch rules block it."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v17",
   "t": 61.19,
   "chunks": [
    "Since 2022, US rules",
    "also curb its top AI chips."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v18",
   "t": 65.67,
   "chunks": [
    "Of course, it's just a machine.",
    "But whoever controls it",
    "controls the AI race."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v19",
   "t": 70.6,
   "chunks": [
    "What should we",
    "take apart next?"
   ]
  }
 ]
}